    A->>M: If your cover began on 7 July 2025, then 4<br/>January 2026 was day 181, the plan’s waiting<br/>period ends on day 181, and cover starts on<br/>day 182, 5 January 2026. So the waiting-period<br/>decline is consistent with ...
