    Note over A,Mem: no tool call: answers from memory
    A->>M: If your cover began on 7 July 2025, the<br/>waiting period ended on 4 January 2026, so you<br/>would have been covered for treatment from 5<br/>January 2026, subject to the plan’s usual<br/>limits. Check your cover start date ...
    A->>Mem: save this turn
    Note over R,Q: text checks pass<br/>judge: 4 of 4 checks pass
    Note over M,Q: TURN 3
    M->>A: Can I appeal it?
